-- WORLD DATABASE. HOME9A: default rarity (1 common .. 5 legendary) of the server furniture. Safe to run more than once.
-- Start the server once with the HOME9A build first (it adds the rarity / ways columns), then import this.
-- ways stays NULL = the default of that rarity (Housing.Rarity.DefaultWays); change a piece from the housing panel (GM) or here.
